Yes, you can do nearest neighbor matching with exact restrictions.  The option is called "exact": see http://gking.harvard.edu/node/4355/rbuild_documentation/Additional_Arguments_f3.html  For optimal matching, you would have to tweak the inputs to outmatch package by Ben Hansen.  I'm not sure how exactly you would do that, but if you figured it out, then you can pass those arguments through matchit() function.

